; RT24 / PT24 (#709), ADR 0047 and PT23/PT24 as updated by PR #836.
; Expectations come from independent arithmetic or stored AutoCAD blocks.
; No Tecnigrafo executable was used to derive these values.

; Suppressions isolate automatic text placement without changing the fit.
; Text sits at the arc midpoint; TAD=1 adds gap along the readable normal.
; A 135-degree tangent is read at -45 degrees; horizontal flags select 0.
; Scale changes height/gap, never the measured angle.

